n between the two.<\\/span><\\/p><p><i><span><strong>III. Is this fish species peaceful or hostile?<\\/strong><\\/span><\\/i><\\/p><p><span>A very peaceful and easy-going fish.<\\/span><\\/p><p><i><span><strong>IV. Species compatibility<\\/strong><\\/span><\\/i><\\/p><p><span>Neon Tetra, Tiger Barb, Plecos, original Danio, and the Dwarf Cichlid<\\/span><\\/p><p><i><span><strong>V. How to feed this species?<\\/strong><\\/span><\\/i><\\/p><p><span>Flakes, pellets, and frozen or freeze-dried meals make up a well-balanced GloFish diet. a diversified diet that includes items high in carotenoids and beta carotene to help maintain your fish\\u2019s beautiful color and guarantee optimum nutritional balance.<\\/span><\\/p><p>&nbsp;<\\/p>\",\"content\":null,\"images\":[null,\"yellow-widow-300x300.jpg\"],\"product_type\":\"physical\",\"sale_type\":\"0\",\"sku\":null,\"price\":\"0\",\"sale_price\":null,\"start_date\":null,\"end_date\":null,\"cost_per_item\":\"0\",\"product_id\":\"442\",\"barcode\":null,\"with_storehouse_management\":\"0\",\"quantity\":\"0\",\"allow_checkout_when_out_of_stock\":\"0\",\"stock_status\":\"in_stock\",\"weight\":\"0\",\"length\":\"0\",\"wide\":\"0\",\"height\":\"0\",\"is_added_attributes\":\"0\",\"has_product_options\":\"1\",\"related_products\":null,\"faq_schema_config\":[[{\"key\":\"question\",\"value\":null},{\"key\":\"answer\",\"value\":null}]],\"seo_meta\":{\"seo_title\":null,\"seo_description\":null,\"index\":\"index\"},\"seo_meta_image\":null,\"language\":\"en_US\",\"layout\":null,\"is_popular\":\"0\",\"status\":\"published\",\"store_id\":null,\"is_featured\":\"0\",\"categories\":[\"34\"],\"brand_id\":null,\"image\":\"yellow-widow-300x300.jpg\",\"minimum_order_quantity\":\"0\",\"maximum_order_quantity\":\"0\",\"tag\":null}', 'updated', 'Mozilla/5.0 (Windows NT 10.0; Win64; x64) AppleWebKit/537.36 (KHTML, like Gecko) Chrome/129.0.0.0 Safari/537.36', '2409:40e0:1b0:d388:c8c7:d8b9:da3c:acb8', 3, 442, 'YELLOW WIDOW', 'primary', '2024-10-24 18:12:1