(2471, 3, 'product', '{\"name\":\"TROCOLOUR ORANDA\",\"model\":\"Botble\\\\Ecommerce\\\\Models\\\\Product\",\"slug\":\"trocolour-oranda\",\"slug_id\":\"464\",\"is_slug_editable\":\"1\",\"description\":\"<p>The Tri-Color Oranda is a distinctive and visually striking variety of the Oranda Goldfish (Carassius auratus). Oranda Goldfish are known for their unique appearance, characterized by a prominent growth on the head called a \\u201cwen\\u201d or \\u201chood,\\u201d which can cover their entire head. The Tri-Color Oranda, as the name suggests, is recognized for its tri-coloration and impressive wen growth. Here are some key features and information about the Tri-Color Oranda:<\\/p><p>Tri-Color Orandas have a tri-colored pattern, typically consisting of red, white, and black markings. The red coloration can appear on the body, while the white and black colors are often on the fins, tail, and head. The exact distribution of colors may vary among individual fish.<\\/p><p>One of the standout features of the Tri-Color Oranda is the growth of the wen or hood. The wen covers the head and can develop into a substantial and fleshy mass, giving the fish a unique and charming appearance. The wen\\u2019s coloration may vary but often matches the body color.<\\/p><p>Oranda Goldfish, including the Tri-Color variety, can grow relatively large. They can reach lengths of up to 8 to 12 inches (20 to 30 centimeters) or even more in well-maintained aquariums or ponds.<\\/p><p>Tri-Color Orandas require a spacious aquarium with ample room to swim, as well as good water quality. They are hardy fish, but their wen growth requires careful attention. The wen is sensitive and prone to injury, so it\\u2019s essential to maintain excellent water conditions to prevent infections or injuries.<\\/p><p>Provide your Tri-Color Oranda with a well-planted aquarium with hiding places and open swimming areas. Ensure that the tank has a suitable filtration system to maintain water quality.<\\/p><p>Oranda Goldfish are generally peaceful and sociable. They are known for their curious and friendly nature, making them enjoyable to observe in a community tank.<\\/p><p>Tri-Color Orandas are beloved by fish enthusiasts for their unique and eye-catching appearance. Their striking coloration, distinctive wen growth, and friendly disposition make them a popular choice for aquarium keepers who are looking to add a touch of elegance to their aquatic displays. Proper care and attention to water quality are essential to ensure the health and well-being of these remarkable fish.<\\/p><p><span><strong>III. Is this fish species peaceful or hostile?<\\/strong><\\/span><\\/p><p><span>Extremely peaceful fish.<\\/span><\\/p><p><i><span><strong>IV. Species compatibility<\\/strong><\\/span><\\/i><\\/p><p>When keeping Tri-Color Orandas, choose tank mates that are peaceful and won\\u2019t nip at their long fins or disturb their wen growth. Other goldfish varieties, such as other Orandas or fancy goldfish, can make suitable companions.<\\/p><p>Avoid keeping them with aggressive or fin-nipping fish, as their delicate fins can be easily damaged.<\\/p><p><i><span><strong>V. How to feed this species?<\\/strong><\\/span><\\/i><\\/p><p>These goldfish are omnivorous and enjoy a varied diet. You can feed them high-quality pellets or flakes formulated for goldfish, as well as occasional treats such as live or frozen foods like brine shrimp, bloodworms, and vegetables like peas.<\\/p>\",\"content\":null,\"images\":[null,\"trocolour-oranda-min-300x300.jpg\"],\"product_type\":\"physical\",\"botble-ecommerce-tables-product-variation-table-428_length\":\"10\",\"has_product_options\":\"1\",\"related_products\":null,\"faq_schema_config\":[[{\"key\":\"question\",\"value\":null},{\"key\":\"answer\",\"value\":null}]],\"seo_meta\":{\"seo_title\":null,\"seo_description\":null,\"index\":\"index\"},\"seo_meta_image\":null,\"language\":\"en_US\",\"layout\":null,\"is_popular\":\"0\",\"status\":\"published\",\"store_id\":null,\"is_featured\":\"0\",\"categories\":[\"36\"],\"brand_id\":null,\"sku\":null,\"image\":\"trocolour-oranda-min-300x300.jpg\",\"product_labels\":[\"2\"],\"minimum_order_quantity\":\"0\",\"maximum_order_quantity\":\"0\",\"tag\":null}', 'updated', 'Mozilla/5.0 (Windows NT 10.0; Win64; x64) AppleWebKit/537.36 (KHTML, like Gecko) Chrome/129.0.0.0 Safari/537.36', '2409:40e0:1b0:d388:7057:f32a:c174:ea68', 3, 428, 'TROCOLOUR ORANDA', 'primary', '2024-10-25 17:49:49', '2024-10-25 17:49:49'),
