zzling colors.<\\/span><\\/p><p><span>Maintaining GloFish\\u00ae is as simple as maintaining Tetras. Keep this tranquil fish alone in tiny aquariums or small schools with other equally peaceful fish for the best care. Feed GloFish\\u00ae a broad diet of flake and frozen meals because they are omnivores.<\\/span><\\/p><p><i><span><strong>III. Is this fish species peaceful or hostile?<\\/strong><\\/span><\\/i><\\/p><p><span>A very peaceful and easy-going fish.<\\/span><\\/p><p><i><span><strong>IV. Species compatibility<\\/strong><\\/span> <\\/i><span>Neon Tetra, Tiger Barb, Plecos, original Danio, and the Dwarf Cichlid<\\/span><\\/p><p>&nbsp;<\\/p><p><span>V. How to feed this species?<\\/span><\\/p><p><span>Flakes, pellets, and frozen or freeze-dried meals make up a well-balanced GloFish diet. a diversified diet that includes items high in carotenoids and beta carotene to help maintain your fish\\u2019s beautiful color and guarantee optimum nutritional balance.<\\/span><\\/p>\",\"content\":null,\"images\":[null,\"purple-widow-300x300-1.jpg\"],\"product_type\":\"physical\",\"sale_type\":\"0\",\"sku\":null,\"price\":\"0\",\"sale_price\":null,\"start_date\":null,\"end_date\":null,\"cost_per_item\":\"0\",\"product_id\":\"441\",\"barcode\":null,\"with_storehouse_management\":\"0\",\"quantity\":\"0\",\"allow_checkout_when_out_of_stock\":\"0\",\"stock_status\":\"in_stock\",\"weight\":\"0\",\"length\":\"0\",\"wide\":\"0\",\"height\":\"0\",\"is_added_attributes\":\"0\",\"has_product_options\":\"1\",\"related_products\":null,\"faq_schema_config\":[[{\"key\":\"question\",\"value\":null},{\"key\":\"answer\",\"value\":null}]],\"seo_meta\":{\"seo_title\":null,\"seo_description\":null,\"index\":\"index\"},\"seo_meta_image\":null,\"submitter\":\"apply\",\"language\":\"en_US\",\"layout\":null,\"is_popular\":\"0\",\"status\":\"published\",\"store_id\":null,\"is_featured\":\"0\",\"brand_id\":null,\"image\":\"purple-widow-300x300-1.jpg\",\"minimum_order_quantity\":\"0\",\"maximum_order_q