(2610, 3, 'page', '{\"name\":\"About Us\",\"model\":\"Botble\\\\Page\\\\Models\\\\Page\",\"slug\":\"about-us\",\"slug_id\":\"77\",\"is_slug_editable\":\"1\",\"description\":null,\"content\":\"<h1 style=\\\"text-align:center;\\\"><span style=\\\"color:hsl(90,75%,60%);font-size:24px;\\\"><i><strong>Little Mermaid<\\/strong><\\/i><\\/span><\\/h1><figure class=\\\"image\\\"><img src=\\\"https:\\/\\/aqua1.teminos.com\\/storage\\/whatsapp-image-2023-10-09-at-172819.jpeg\\\" alt=\\\"WhatsApp-Image-2023-10-09-at-17.28.19\\\" loading=\\\"lazy\\\"><\\/figure><p style=\\\"text-align:center;\\\"><span style=\\\"background-color:rgb(255,255,255);color:rgb(51,51,51);font-size:16px;\\\"><i><span><strong>&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; The Founders: Mr. Indranil Chowdhury &amp; Mrs. Rishita Chowdhury<\\/strong>&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;&nbsp;<\\/span> &nbsp;<\\/i><\\/span> &nbsp;<\\/p><div class=\\\"raw-html-embed\\\"><\\/div><h4 style=\\\"line-height:1.38;text-align:center;\\\" dir=\\\"ltr\\\">&nbsp;<\\/h4><h2 style=\\\"text-align:center;\\\"><span style=\\\"background-color:transparent;color:hsl(0,0%,0%);font-size:22px;\\\"><span><strong>Your #TankMatesForLife<\\/strong>&nbsp;&nbsp;<\\/span> &nbsp;<\\/span> &nbsp;<span style=\\\"background-color:transparent;color:#666666;font-size:15px;\\\"><span>&nbsp;<\\/span> &nbsp;<\\/span><\\/h2><h4 style=\\\"line-height:1.38;text-align:center;\\\" dir=\\\"ltr\\\"><span style=\\\"background-color:transparent;color:#666666;\\\"><span>&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;&nbsp;<\\/span> &nbsp;<\\/span><\\/h4><p style=\\\"line-height:1.38;text-align:center;\\\" dir=\\\"ltr\\\"><span style=\\\"background-color:transparent;color:#1a1a1a;font-family:\'Trebuchet MS\', Helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:20px;\\\"><span>Little Mermaid was established in 2015 to cater to the needs&nbsp; &nbsp;&nbsp;<\\/span> &nbsp;<\\/span><\\/p><p style=\\\"line-height:1.38;text-align:center;\\\" dir=\\\"ltr\\\"><span style=\\\"background-color:transparent;color:#1a1a1a;font-family:\'Trebuchet MS\', Helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:20px;\\\"><span>&nbsp;of aquarium hobbyists in Kolkata. With two thriving outlets in Kolkata, West Bengal,&nbsp; &nbsp;&nbsp;<\\/span> &nbsp;<\\/span><\\/p><p style=\\\"line-height:1.38;text-align:center;\\\" dir=\\\"ltr\\\"><span style=\\\"background-color:transparent;color:#1a1a1a;font-family:\'Trebuchet MS\', Helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:20px;\\\"><span>&nbsp;we\'ve been fortunate&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;<\\/span> &nbsp;<\\/span><\\/p><p style=\\\"line-height:1.38;text-align:center;\\\" dir=\\\"ltr\\\"><span style=\\\"background-color:transparent;color:#1a1a1a;font-family:\'Trebuchet MS\', Helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:20px;\\\"><span>to receive overwhelming support from our community. Our diverse inventory, fresh aquatic plants, and healthy ornamental fish have made us a favorite among local hobbyists. Inspired by this positive response, we decided to expand our reach and bring the same quality and passion to a broader audience through our new e-commerce portal. Now, you can enjoy the Little Mermaid experience from the comfort of your home!&nbsp; &nbsp;&nbsp;<\\/span> &nbsp;<\\/span><\\/p><p>&nbsp;<\\/p><p style=\\\"line-height:1.38;text-align:center;\\\" dir=\\\"ltr\\\"><span style=\\\"background-color:transparent;color:#1a1a1a;font-family:\'Trebuchet MS\', Helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:18px;\\\"><span>&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;<\\/span> &nbsp;<\\/span><\\/p><p style=\\\"text-align:center;\\\"><span style=\\\"background-color:#ffffff;color:hsl(90,75%,60%);font-size:24px;\\\"><i><span><strong>&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; Why choose us<\\/strong>&nbsp;&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;<\\/span> &nbsp;<\\/i><\\/span><\\/p><p style=\\\"text-align:center;\\\"><span style=\\\"background-color:#ffffff;color:#4ca1a6;font-size:23px;\\\"><i><span>&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;<\\/span> &nbsp;<\\/i><\\/span><\\/p><p style=\\\"line-hei