f at least 6 fish to avoid harrassment of subdominant specimens, or else it should be kept singly.&nbsp;Aggression can be kept to a minimum in a larger tank with plenty of territory and cover for each fish.<\\/div><div><div><strong>What We Like About This Fish:<\\/strong><\\/div><div><ul><li>Voracious algae eater<\\/li><li>Will not eat ornamental plants<\\/li><li>Generally peaceful disposition with fish and peaceful larger invertebrates<\\/li><li>Very active and noticeable fish in any aquarium<\\/li><li>Very hardy<\\/li><\\/ul><\\/div><div>&nbsp;<\\/div><div>&nbsp;<\\/div><div><strong>RECOMMENDED TANK PARAMETERS:<\\/strong><\\/div><div><ul><li>Temperature:&nbsp; 72\\u00b0 - 79\\u00b0 F (22\\u00b0 - 26\\u00b0 C)<\\/li><li>pH:&nbsp; 6.5 - 7.5<\\/li><li>KH:&nbsp; 4 - 15 dKH<\\/li><li><p>Minimum tank size:&nbsp; 50 gallons<\\/p><div><strong>CARE GUIDELINES:<\\/strong><\\/div><div><ul><li>Diet:&nbsp; Omnivorous. Will easily accept high quality dry and frozen foods as well as fresh vegetables. Should be fed mostly vegetable matter.<\\/li><li>Social behavior:&nbsp; Generally peaceful, schooling\\/shoaling as a juvenile. Can be somewhat territoral with its own kind or similar fish as an adult<\\/li><\\/ul><\\/div><\\/li><\\/ul><\\/div><\\/div>\",\"content\":null,\"images\":[null,\"siamese-algae-eater-min-300x300.jpg\"],\"product_type\":\"physical\",\"sale_type\":\"0\",\"sku\":null,\"price\":\"50\",\"sale_price\":null,\"start_date\":null,\"end_date\":null,\"cost_per_item\":\"0\",\"product_id\":\"439\",\"barcode\":null,\"with_storehouse_management\":\"0\",\"quantity\":\"0\",\"allow_checkout_when_out_of_stock\":\"0\",\"stock_status\":\"in_stock\",\"weight\":\"0\",\"length\":\"0\",\"wide\":\"0\",\"height\":\"0\",\"is_added_attributes\":\"0\",\"has_product_options\":\"1\",\"related_products\":null,\"faq_schema_config\":[[{\"key\":\"question\",\"value\":null},{\"key\":\"answer\",\"value\":null}]],\"seo_meta\":{\"seo_title\":null,\"seo_description\":null,\"index\":\"index\"},\"seo