(151, 'WA Goldfish Grandeur Pellets | 100ml – 40g', '<p style=\"color:rgb(105,105,105);font-family:Poppins, sans-serif;font-size:16px;font-style:normal;font-weight:400;word-spacing:0px;\"><strong style=\"font-weight:bolder;\">WA Goldfish Grandeur Pellets | 100ml – 40g</strong></p><p style=\"color:rgb(105,105,105);font-family:Poppins, sans-serif;font-size:16px;font-style:normal;font-weight:400;word-spacing:0px;\">Goldfish is a voracious eater, it keeps on eating until you stop feeding. Do not feed too much volume of feed, as it may cause water pollution and also digestion problem.</p><h4 style=\"font-family:\'Sans-serif\';font-style:normal;word-spacing:0px;\"><strong style=\"font-weight:bolder;\">Ingredients</strong></h4><p style=\"color:rgb(105,105,105);font-family:Poppins, sans-serif;font-size:16px;font-style:normal;font-weight:400;word-spacing:0px;\">Fish meal, Wheat flour, Fish hydrolysate, Krill-meal, Shrimp meal, Soy lecithin, Fish oil, Inositol, Astaxanthine, Phycocyanin, Beta-Carotene, Spirulina, Yeast powder, Vitamin A, D, E , K &amp; C, Vitamin B complex, trace minerals (Cu, Na, Fe, I, Mn, Co, Zn &amp; Se) amino acids (18 types), and essential fatty acids.</p><h4 style=\"font-family:\'Sans-serif\';font-style:normal;word-spacing:0px;\"><strong style=\"font-weight:bolder;\">Instruction</strong></h4><p style=\"color:rgb(105,105,105);font-family:Poppins, sans-serif;font-size:16px;font-style:normal;font-weight:400;word-spacing:0px;\">Feed twice a day. Remove uneaten feed. Not for human consumption. Keep out of reach of children. Keep at room temperature</p><h4 style=\"font-family:\'Sans-serif\';font-style:normal;word-spacing:0px;\"><strong style=\"font-weight:bolder;\">Nutritional Fact</strong></h4><ul><li>Protein – 34%</li><li>Fat – 5%</li><li>Fiber – 4%</li><li>Moisture – 9%</li></ul>', '', 'published', '[\"inshot-20240704-174405071-1.jpg\"]', NULL, NULL, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 8, 0, 0, 200, 160, NULL, NULL, 0.00, 0.00, 0.00, 0.00, 0, 10, '2024-09-09 17:36:25', '2024-