(326, 'AQUATIC VENTUREZ Vitamix Power | 120ml', '<ul><li>Multi-vitamin supplement</li><li>Includes 15 types of vitamins</li><li>Boosts immunity</li></ul><div class=\"large-10 col pb-0 mb-0\"><div class=\"panel entry-content\"><p class=\"uppercase\"><strong style=\"font-weight:bolder;\">AQUATIC VENTUREZ Vitamix Power</strong><br> </p><p>This concentrated formula offers one of the best multi-vitamin supplement for the well-being of aquarium fishes. It has got a perfect formulation which includes 15 types of vitamins which boosts immunity and strengthens the natural defences against diseases.</p><p><strong style=\"font-weight:bolder;\">USAGE INSTRUCTIONS:</strong><br>Soak 1 table-spoon of dried feed into 2 ml vitamix solution for 1 minutes and feed your fish.<br>Cap-full is 6 ml.</p></div></div>', '', 'published', '[\"untitled-design281-min.png\"]', NULL, NULL, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 15, 0, 0, 250, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0.00, 0.00, 0.00, 0.00, 0, 12, '2024-09-11 18:00:45', '2024-10-07 13:07:58', 'in_stock', 3, 'Botble\\ACL\\Models\\User', 'untitled-design281-min.png', 'physical', NULL, NULL, 0, 0, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, 0),
