(357, 'Sunken Garden Cichlid Fish Water Conditioner 100Ml', '<p style=\"color:rgb(105,105,105);font-family:Poppins, sans-serif;font-size:16px;font-style:normal;font-weight:400;word-spacing:0px;\">Embark on a journey to create the perfect aquatic home for your vibrant cichlid community with Sunken Garden Cichlid Conditioner. Meticulously designed to meet the specific needs of cichlids, this conditioner replicates their natural habitat, ensuring their health, vitality, and the stunning beauty that these fish are known for.</p><p style=\"color:rgb(105,105,105);font-family:Poppins, sans-serif;font-size:16px;font-style:normal;font-weight:400;word-spacing:0px;\"><strong style=\"font-weight:bolder;\"> Benefits:</strong></p><ol><li>pH Reducer: Sunken Garden Cichlid Conditioner adeptly lowers and stabilises pH levels, recreating the slightly acidic and hard water conditions favoured by cichlids. Transform your aquarium into an authentic representation of their native environment.<ol><li>Chlorine Neutraliser: Instantly neutralises harmful chlorine and chloramines from tap water, safeguarding your cichlids from stress and potential health issues. Create a safe and serene aquatic haven for your prized cichlid community.</li><li>Beneficial Bacteria Booster: Enriched with specialised strains of beneficial bacteria, this conditioner supports a healthy nitrogen cycle in your aquarium. These microorganisms actively reduce ammonia and nitrite levels, promoting a balanced and thriving ecosystem.<ol><li>Stress Relief: Sunken Garden Cichlid Conditioner is thoughtfully formulated to keep your cichlids stress-free and content. By reducing stress, it enhances overall well-being and vitality, allowing your cichlids to thrive in their natural-inspired environment.</li><li>Disease Prevention: Protect your cichlid community from common aquatic diseases, including Tuberculosis (TB) and gill flukes. Our conditioner creates a protective shield, ensuring a disease-free and secure aquatic environment.<strong style=\"font-weight:bolder;\">  Directions for use:</strong><ul><li>Shake well before use.</li><li>Add 1ml for every 5 litres of water.</li><li>Overdosing does not affect aquatic life.</li><li>Consume within 120 days of opening the bottle.</li><li>Store in a cool, dry place.</li></ul></li></ol></li></ol></li></ol>', '', 'published', '[\"sunken-garden-cichlid-fish-water-conditioner-100ml-min.jpg\"]', NULL, NULL, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 9, 0, 0, 290, 261, NULL, NULL, 0.00, 0.00, 0.00, 0.00, 0, 1, '2024-09-12 01:52:52', '2024-10-04 17:47:23', 'in_stock', 3, 'Botble\\ACL\\Models\\User', 'sunken-garden-cichlid-fish-water-conditioner-100ml-min.jpg', 'physical', NULL, NULL, 0, 0, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, 0),
