 diseases, including Tuberculosis (TB) and gill flukes. Our conditioner creates a protective shield, ensuring a disease-free and secure aquatic environment.</li></ol><p style=\"color:rgb(105,105,105);font-family:Poppins, sans-serif;font-size:16px;font-style:normal;font-weight:400;word-spacing:0px;\"><strong style=\"font-weight:bolder;\">      Directions for use:</strong></p><ul><li>Shake well before use.</li><li>Add 1ml for every 5 litres of water.</li><li>Overdosing does not affect aquatic life.</li><li>Consume within 120 days of opening the bottle.</li><li>Store in a cool, dry place.</li></ul>', '', 'published', '[\"untitled-design218-min.png\"]', NULL, NULL, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 9, 0, 0, 490, 441, NULL, NULL, 0.00, 0.00, 0.00, 0.00, 0, 3, '2024-09-12 01:57:28', '2024-10-04 17:46:49', 'in_stock', 3, 'Botble\\ACL\\Models\\User', 'untitled-design218-min.png', 'physical', NULL, NULL, 0, 0, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, 0),
(359, 'Sunken Garden CO2 Booster 100ml', '<p style=\"color:rgb(105,105,105);font-family:Poppins, sans-serif;font-size:16px;font-style:normal;font-weight:400;word-spacing:0px;\">Elevate your aquatic plant growth with Sunken Garden Liquid CO2. Designed as a rich source of bioavailable organic carbon, this innovative formula provides the essential fuel that all plants crave. While carbon dioxide (CO2) is traditionally obtained from the atmosphere, our solution offers an alternative by delivering organic carbon derived from simple compounds.</p><p style=\"color:rgb(105,105,105);font-family:Poppins, sans-serif;font-size:16px;font-style:normal;font-weight:400;word-spacing:0px;\">Fueling photosynthesis, Sunken Garden Liquid CO2 ensures robust plant development, vibrant colors, and lush greenery. It’s a game-changer for aquatic plant enthusiasts seeking to create a thriving underwater garden.</p><p style=\"color:rgb(105,105,105);font-family:Poppins, sans-serif;font-size:16px;font-style:normal;font-weight:400;word-spacing:0px;\">Sunken Garden Liquid CO2 is designed to posses iron-reducing properties, promoting the ferrous state of iron (Fe) over ferric iron (Fe). By doing so, it maximizes iron utilization by plants, further enhancing their growth and vitality.</p>', '', 'published', '[\"untitled-design214-min.png\"]', NULL, NULL, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 9, 0, 0, 490, 441, NULL, NULL, 0.00, 0.00, 0.00, 0.00, 0, 7, '2024-09-12 02:05:17', '2024-10-04 17:45:41', 'in_stock', 3, 'Botble\\ACL\\Models\\User', 'untitled-design214-min.png', 'physical', NULL, NULL, 0, 0, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, 0),
(360, 'Sunken Garden CO2 Booster 200ml+30ml free', '<p style=\"color:rgb(105,105,105);font-family:Poppins, sans-serif;font-size:16px;font-style:normal;font-weight:400;word-spacing:0px;\">Elevate your aquatic plant growth with Sunken Garden Liquid CO2. Designed as a rich source of bioavailable organic carbon, this innovative formula provides the essential fuel that all plants crave. While carbon dioxide (CO2) is traditionally obtained from the atmosphere, our solution offers an alternative by delivering organic carbon derived from simple compounds.</p><p style=\"color:rgb(105,105,105);font-family:Poppins, sans-serif;font-size:16px;font-style:normal;font-weight:400;word-spacing:0px;\">Fueling photosynthesis, Sunken Garden Liquid CO2 ensures robust plant development, vibrant colors, and lush greenery. It’s a game-changer for aquatic plant enthusiasts seeking to create a thriving underwater garden.</p><p style=\"color:rgb(105,105,105);font-family:Poppins, sans-serif;font-size:16px;font-style:normal;font-weight:400;word-spacing:0px;\">Sunken Garden Liquid CO2 is designed to posses iron-reducing properties, promoting the ferrous state of iron (Fe) over ferric iron (Fe). By doing so, it maximizes iron utilization by plants, further enhancing their growth and vitality.</p>', '', 'published', '[\"untitled-design229-min.png\"]', NULL, NULL, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 9, 0, 0, 790, 711, NULL, NULL, 0.00, 0.00, 0.00, 0.00, 0, 8, '2024-09-12 02:06:38', '2024-10-04 17:45:00', 'in_stock', 3, 'Botble\\ACL\\Models\\User', 'untitled-design229-min.png', 'physical', NULL, NULL, 0, 0, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, 0),
(361, 'Sunken Garden Discus Fish Water Conditioner 100Ml', '<p style=\"background-color:rgb(255,255,255);color:rgb(105,105,105);font-family:Poppins, sans-serif;font-size:16px;font-style:normal;font-weight:400;word-spacing:0px;\">Dive into the world of captivating discus fish with Sunken Garden Discus Conditioner, meticulously crafted to cater to the unique needs of these mesmerising aquatic treasures. Discus enthusiasts, prepare to unlock the secrets of thriving discus keeping with a conditioner designed to replicate their natural habitat and ensure their health and vitality.</p><p style=\"background-color:rgb(255,255,255);color:rgb(105,105,105);font-family:Poppins, sans-serif;font-size:16px;font-style:normal;font-weight:400;word-spacing:0px;\"><strong style=\"font-weight:bolder;\">Benefits:</strong></p><ol><li>pH Reducer: Sunken Garden Discus Conditioner skilfully lowers and stabilises pH levels, recreating the slightly acidic, soft water conditions favoured by discus fish. Transform your aquarium into a haven that closely resembles their native Amazonian environment.</li><li>Chlorine Neutraliser: Instantly neutralises harmful chlorine and chloramines from tap water, shielding your discus fish from stress and potential health issues. Create a safe and serene aquatic haven for your prized discus.</li><li>Beneficial Bacteria Booster: Enriched with specialised strains of beneficial bacteria, this conditioner supports a healthy nitrogen cycle in your aquarium. These microorganisms actively reduce ammonia and nitrite levels, promoting a balanced and thriving ecosystem.</li><li>Stress Relief: Sunken Garden Discus Conditioner is thoughtfully formulated to keep your discus fish stress-free and content. By reducing stress, it enhances overall well-being and vitality, allowing your discus to thrive in their natural-inspired environment.</li><li>Fluke Prevention: Protect your discus fish from common aquatic pests, including flukes. Our conditioner creates a protective shield, ensuring a pest-free and secure aquatic environment.</li></ol><p style=\"background-color:rgb(255,255,255);color:rgb(105,105,105);font-family:Poppins, sans-serif;font-size:16px;font-style:normal;font-weight:400;word-spacing:0px;\"><strong style=\"font-weight:bolder;\">        Directions for use:</strong></p><ul><li>Shake well before use.</li><li>Add 1ml for every 5 litres of water.</li><li>Overdosing does not affect aquatic life.</li><li>Store in a cool, dry place.</li></ul>', '', 'published', '[\"untitled-design219-min.png\"]', NULL, NULL, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 9, 0, 0, 290, 261, NULL, NULL, 0.00, 0.00, 0.00, 0.00, 0, 6, '2024-09-12 02:08:03', '2024-10-04 17:44:31', 'in_stock', 3, 'Botble\\ACL\\Models\\User', 'untitled-design219-min.png', 'physical', NULL, NULL, 0, 0, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, 0),
