(363, 'Sunken Garden Flowerhorn Fish Water Conditioner 100Ml', '<p style=\"background-color:rgb(255,255,255);color:rgb(105,105,105);font-family:Poppins, sans-serif;font-size:16px;font-style:normal;font-weight:400;word-spacing:0px;\">Enter the world of magnificent Flower-horn cichlids with Sunken Garden Flower-horn Conditioner, meticulously designed to cater to the unique needs of these remarkable fish. This conditioner recreates their natural habitat, ensuring their health, vibrancy, and the stunning beauty that Flower-horns are known for.</p><p style=\"background-color:rgb(255,255,255);color:rgb(105,105,105);font-family:Poppins, sans-serif;font-size:16px;font-style:normal;font-weight:400;word-spacing:0px;\"> </p><p style=\"background-color:rgb(255,255,255);color:rgb(105,105,105);font-family:Poppins, sans-serif;font-size:16px;font-style:normal;font-weight:400;word-spacing:0px;\"><strong style=\"font-weight:bolder;\">     Benefits:</strong></p><ol><li>pH Reducer: Sunken Garden Flower-horn Conditioner expertly lowers and stabilizes pH levels, replicating the slightly acidic and soft water conditions favoured by Flower-horns. Transform your aquarium into an authentic representation of their native environment.</li><li>Chlorine Neutraliser: Instantly neutralises harmful chlorine and chloramines from tap water, safeguarding your Flower-horns from stress and potential health issues. Create a safe and serene aquatic haven for your prized Flower-horns.</li><li>Beneficial Bacteria Booster: Enriched with specialised strains of beneficial bacteria, this conditioner supports a healthy nitrogen cycle in your aquarium. These microorganisms actively reduce ammonia and nitrite levels, promoting a balanced and thriving ecosystem.</li><li>Stress Relief: Sunken Garden Flower-horn Conditioner is thoughtfully formulated to keep your Flower-horns stress-free and content. By reducing stress, it enhances overall well-being and vitality, allowing your Flower-horns to thrive in their natural-inspired environment.</li><li>Hexamita Prevention: Protect your Flower-horns from common aquatic diseases, including Hexamita. Our conditioner creates a protective shield, ensuring a disease-free and secure aquatic environment.</li></ol><p style=\"background-color:rgb(255,255,255);color:rgb(105,105,105);font-family:Poppins, sans-serif;font-size:16px;font-style:normal;font-weight:400;word-spacing:0px;\"> </p><p style=\"background-color:rgb(255,255,255);color:rgb(105,105,105);font-family:Poppins, sans-serif;font-size:16px;font-style:normal;font-weight:400;word-spacing:0px;\"><strong style=\"font-weight:bolder;\">     Directions for use:</strong></p><ul><li>Shake well before use.</li><li>Add 1ml for every 5 litres of water.</li><li>Overdosing does not affect aquatic life.</li><li>Store in a cool, dry place.</li></ul>', '', 'published', '[\"untitled-design212-min.png\"]', NULL, NULL, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 9, 0, 0, 290, 261, NULL, NULL, 0.00, 0.00, 0.00, 0.00, 0, 4, '2024-09-12 02:12:18', '2024-10-04 17:39:40', 'in_stock', 3, 'Botble\\ACL\\Models\\User', 'untitled-design212-min.png', 'physical', NULL, NULL, 0, 0, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, 0),
(364, 'Sunken Garden Goldfish Water Conditioner 200Ml + 30Ml Free', '<p style=\"-webkit-text-stroke-width:0px;background-color:rgb(255, 255, 255);box-sizing:border-box;color:rgb(105, 105, 105);font-family:Poppins, sans-serif;font-size:16px;font-style:normal;font-variant-caps:normal;font-variant-ligatures:normal;font-weight:400;letter-spacing:normal;margin-block:0px 0.9rem;orphans:2;text-align:start;text-decoration-color:initial;text-decoration-style:initial;text-decoration-thickness:initial;text-indent:0px;text-transform:none;white-space:normal;widows:2;word-spacing:0px;\">Transform your aquarium into a vibrant aquatic paradise with Sunken Garden Goldfish Conditioner. Specially formulated to cater to the unique needs of your goldfish, this conditioner is your gateway to a thriving and harmonious underwater world. Enhance the well-being of your goldfish while replicating their natural habitat with ease.</p><p style=\"-webkit-text-stroke-width:0px;background-color:rgb(255, 255, 255);box-sizing:border-box;color:rgb(105, 105, 105);font-family:Poppins, sans-serif;font-size:16px;font-style:normal;font-variant-caps:normal;font-variant-ligatures:normal;font-weight:400;letter-spacing:normal;margin-block:0px 0.9rem;orphans:2;text-align:start;text-decoration-color:initial;text-decoration-style:initial;text-decoration-thickness:initial;text-indent:0px;text-transform:none;white-space:normal;widows:2;word-spacing:0px;\"><strong style=\"box-sizing:border-box;font-weight:bolder;\">Benefits:</strong></p><ol><li>pH Balancer: Sunken Garden Goldfish Conditioner elevates and stabilises pH levels, creating an environment that closely mimics the best conditions for your goldfish. This ensures optimal health and comfort for your aquatic companions.</li><li start=\"2\">Chlorine Neutraliser : Instantly neutralises harmful chlorine and chloramines from tap water, safeguarding your goldfish from stress and potential health issues. Say goodbye to water worries and hello to a tranquil aquarium.</li><li start=\"3\">Beneficial Bacteria Booster: Enriched with specialised strains of beneficial bacteria, this conditioner supports a healthy nitrogen cycle in your aquarium. These microbes actively reduce ammonia and nitrite levels, promoting a pristine and balanced ecosystem.</li><li start=\"4\">Stress Relief: Sunken Garden Goldfish Conditioner is expertly designed to keep your goldfish calm and content. By reducing stress, it enhances overall well-being and vitality, allowing your goldfish to thrive in their aquatic haven.</li><li start=\"5\">Parasite Prevention: Guard your goldfish against common aquatic pests such as lice and anchor worms. Our conditioner forms a protective barrier, ensuring a pest-free and secure environment.</li></ol><p style=\"-webkit-text-stroke-width:0px;background-color:rgb(255, 255, 255);box-sizing:border-box;color:rgb(105, 105, 105);font-family:Poppins, sans-serif;font-size:16px;font-style:normal;font-variant-caps:normal;font-variant-ligatures:normal;font-weight:400;letter-spacing:normal;margin-block:0px 0.9rem;orphans:2;text-align:start;text-decoration-color:initial;text-decoration-style:initial;text-decoration-thickness:initial;text-indent:0px;text-transform:none;white-space:normal;widows:2;word-spacing:0px;\"><strong style=\"box-sizing:border-box;font-weight:bolder;\">&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;Directions for use:</strong></p><ul><li>Shake well before use.</li><li>Add 1ml for every 5 litres of water.</li><li>Overdosing does not affect aquatic life.</li><li>Store in a cool, dry place.</li></ul>', NULL, 'published', '[\"untitled-design208-min.png\"]', NULL, NULL, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 490, 441, NULL, NULL, 0.00, 0.00, 0.00, 0.00, 0, 4, '2024-09-12 02:14:51', '2024-09-12 02:14:51', 'in_stock', 3, 'Botble\\ACL\\Models\\User', NULL, 'physical', NULL, NULL, 0, 0, 0, 0, NULL, 0, 0),
(365, 'Sunken Garden Good Bacteria 200ML+30ML', '<p style=\"color:rgb(105,105,105);font-family:Poppins, sans-serif;font-size:16px;font-style:normal;font-weight:400;word-spacing:0px;\">Sunken Garden Good Bacteria 100 ML” appears to be a product designed to introduce beneficial bacteria into an aquatic environment. These bacteria play a crucial role in maintaining a healthy ecosystem within aquariums, ponds, or other aquatic environments.</p><p style=\"color:rgb(105,105,105);font-family:Poppins, sans-serif;font-size:16px;font-style:normal;font-weight:400;word-spacing:0px;\">Beneficial bacteria help in breaking down organic waste, such as uneaten fish food, fish waste, and decaying plant matter, into less harmful substances like ammonia and nitrite, which can then be processed further by the aquarium’s filtration system. This helps in keeping the water quality stable and reducing the risk of harmful spikes in ammonia or nitrite levels, which can be harmful to aquatic life.</p><p style=\"color:rgb(105,105,105);font-family:Poppins, sans-serif;font-size:16px;font-style:normal;font-weight:400;word-spacing:0px;\"> </p><p style=\"color:rgb(105,105,105);font-family:Poppins, sans-serif;font-size:16px;font-style:normal;font-weight:400;word-spacing:0px;\"><strong style=\"font-weight:bolder;\">Directions for use:</strong></p><ul><li>Add daily after every water change.</li><li>Shake well before use.</li><li>Add 1ml for every 10 litres of water.</li><li>Overdosing does not affect aquatic life.</li><li>Store in a cool, dry place.</li></ul>', '', 'published', '[\"untitled-design225-min.png\"]', NULL, NULL, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 9, 0, 0, 790, 711, NULL, NULL, 0.00, 0.00, 0.00, 0.00, 0, 5, '2024-09-12 02:17:48', '2024-10-04 17:42:35', 'out_of_stock', 3, 'Botble\\ACL\\Models\\User', 'untitled-design225-min.png', 'physical', NULL, NULL, 0, 0, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, 0);
