(366, 'Sunken Garden Koi Fish Water Conditioner 100Ml', '<p style=\"background-color:rgb(255,255,255);color:rgb(105,105,105);font-family:Poppins, sans-serif;font-size:16px;font-style:normal;font-weight:400;word-spacing:0px;\"><strong style=\"font-weight:bolder;\">Description:</strong></p><p style=\"background-color:rgb(255,255,255);color:rgb(105,105,105);font-family:Poppins, sans-serif;font-size:16px;font-style:normal;font-weight:400;word-spacing:0px;\">Step into the world of serene koi ponds and elevate your Koi’s aquatic experience with Sunken Garden Koi Conditioner. This meticulously crafted conditioner is designed to cater to the unique needs of Koi fish, ensuring their health, vibrancy, and the tranquil beauty that Koi enthusiasts cherish.</p><p style=\"background-color:rgb(255,255,255);color:rgb(105,105,105);font-family:Poppins, sans-serif;font-size:16px;font-style:normal;font-weight:400;word-spacing:0px;\"><strong style=\"font-weight:bolder;\">        Benefits:</strong></p><ol><li>pH Reducer: Sunken Garden Koi Conditioner expertly lowers and stabilises pH levels, creating a water environment that is ideal for Koi. Replicate the slightly acidic and soft water conditions preferred by Koi, reminiscent of their native habitats.</li><li>Chlorine Neutraliser: Instantly neutralises harmful chlorine and chloramines from tap water, shielding your Koi from stress and potential health issues. Create a safe and serene aquatic haven for your treasured Koi.</li><li>Beneficial Bacteria Booster: Enriched with specialised strains of beneficial bacteria, this conditioner supports a healthy nitrogen cycle in your pond. These microorganisms actively reduce ammonia and nitrite levels, promoting a balanced and thriving ecosystem.</li><li>Stress Relief: Sunken Garden Koi Conditioner is thoughtfully formulated to keep your Koi stress-free and content. By reducing stress, it enhances overall well-being and vitality, allowing your Koi to thrive in their natural-inspired environment.</li><li>Bloat Prevention: Protect your Koi from common digestive issues, such as bloat. Our conditioner creates a protective shield, ensuring a healthy and secure aquatic environment.</li></ol><p style=\"background-color:rgb(255,255,255);color:rgb(105,105,105);font-family:Poppins, sans-serif;font-size:16px;font-style:normal;font-weight:400;word-spacing:0px;\"><strong style=\"font-weight:bolder;\"> </strong></p><p style=\"background-color:rgb(255,255,255);color:rgb(105,105,105);font-family:Poppins, sans-serif;font-size:16px;font-style:normal;font-weight:400;word-spacing:0px;\"><strong style=\"font-weight:bolder;\">      Directions for use:</strong></p><ul><li>Shake well before use.</li><li>Add 1ml for every 5 litres of water.</li><li>Overdosing does not affect aquatic life.</li><li>Store in a cool, dry place.</li></ul>', '', 'published', '[\"untitled-design224-min.png\"]', NULL, NULL, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 9, 0, 0, 290, 261, NULL, NULL, 0.00, 0.00, 0.00, 0.00, 0, 7, '2024-09-12 02:19:34', '2024-10-04 17:42:54', 'in_stock', 3, 'Botble\\ACL\\Models\\User', 'untitled-design224-min.png', 'physical', NULL, NULL, 0, 0, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, 0),
(367, 'Sunken Garden Koi Fish Water Conditioner 200Ml + 30Ml Free', '<p style=\"background-color:rgb(255,255,255);color:rgb(105,105,105);font-family:Poppins, sans-serif;font-size:16px;font-style:normal;font-weight:400;word-spacing:0px;\"><strong style=\"font-weight:bolder;\">Description:</strong></p><p style=\"background-color:rgb(255,255,255);color:rgb(105,105,105);font-family:Poppins, sans-serif;font-size:16px;font-style:normal;font-weight:400;word-spacing:0px;\">Step into the world of serene koi ponds and elevate your Koi’s aquatic experience with Sunken Garden Koi Conditioner. This meticulously crafted conditioner is designed to cater to the unique needs of Koi fish, ensuring their health, vibrancy, and the tranquil beauty that Koi enthusiasts cherish.</p><p style=\"background-color:rgb(255,255,255);color:rgb(105,105,105);font-family:Poppins, sans-serif;font-size:16px;font-style:normal;font-weight:400;word-spacing:0px;\"><strong style=\"font-weight:bolder;\">        Benefits:</strong></p><ol><li>pH Reducer: Sunken Garden Koi Conditioner expertly lowers and stabilises pH levels, creating a water environment that is ideal for Koi. Replicate the slightly acidic and soft water conditions preferred by Koi, reminiscent of their native habitats.</li><li>Chlorine Neutraliser: Instantly neutralises harmful chlorine and chloramines from tap water, shielding your Koi from stress and potential health issues. Create a safe and serene aquatic haven for your treasured Koi.</li><li>Beneficial Bacteria Booster: Enriched with specialised strains of beneficial bacteria, this conditioner supports a healthy nitrogen cycle in your pond. These microorganisms actively reduce ammonia and nitrite levels, promoting a balanced and thriving ecosystem.</li><li>Stress Relief: Sunken Garden Koi Conditioner is thoughtfully formulated to keep your Koi stress-free and content. By reducing stress, it enhances overall well-being and vitality, allowing your Koi to thrive in their natural-inspired environment.</li><li>Bloat Prevention: Protect your Koi from common digestive issues, such as bloat. Our conditioner creates a protective shield, ensuring a healthy and secure aquatic environment.</li></ol><p style=\"background-color:rgb(255,255,255);color:rgb(105,105,105);font-family:Poppins, sans-serif;font-size:16px;font-style:normal;font-weight:400;word-spacing:0px;\"><strong style=\"font-weight:bolder;\"> </strong></p><p style=\"background-color:rgb(255,255,255);color:rgb(105,105,105);font-family:Poppins, sans-serif;font-size:16px;font-style:normal;font-weight:400;word-spacing:0px;\"><strong style=\"font-weight:bolder;\">      Directions for use:</strong></p><ul><li>Shake well before use.</li><li>Add 1ml for every 5 litres of water.</li><li>Overdosing does not affect aquatic life.</li><li>Store in a cool, dry place.</li></ul>', '', 'published', '[\"untitled-design210-min.png\"]', NULL, NULL, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 9, 0, 0, 490, 441, NULL, NULL, 0.00, 0.00, 0.00, 0.00, 0, 7, '2024-09-12 02:22:00', '2024-10-04 17:42:12', 'in_stock', 3, 'Botble\\ACL\\Models\\User', 'untitled-design210-min.png', 'physical', NULL, NULL, 0, 0, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, 0),
(368, 'Sunken Garden Stop Worms 200Ml + 30Ml', '<p style=\"color:rgb(105,105,105);font-family:Poppins, sans-serif;font-size:16px;font-style:normal;font-weight:400;word-spacing:0px;\">Sunken Garden Stop Worms is designed for maintaining a healthy environment in freshwater aquariums by managing parasitic issues in fish. This treatment effectively combats intestinal invaders, ensuring the well-being of your aquatic pets. It’s crafted to be effective against common aquatic pests while being gentle enough for various species of freshwater fish.</p><p style=\"color:rgb(105,105,105);font-family:Poppins, sans-serif;font-size:16px;font-style:normal;font-weight:400;word-spacing:0px;\">Regular use of this product helps to keep your aquarium free from parasites, promoting a thriving environment. It’s ideal for both routine preventive care and targeted intervention. Sunken Garden Stop Worms is a vital tool for sustaining the health and vitality of your fish, ensuring they live in a clean and safe habitat.</p><p style=\"color:rgb(105,105,105);font-family:Poppins, sans-serif;font-size:16px;font-style:normal;font-weight:400;word-spacing:0px;\">Additionally, it is safe for use with invertebrates, such as shrimp and snails.</p><p style=\"color:rgb(105,105,105);font-family:Poppins, sans-serif;font-size:16px;font-style:normal;font-weight:400;word-spacing:0px;\"><strong style=\"font-weight:bolder;\">Directions for use:</strong></p><ul><li>Shake well before use.</li><li>Add 1ml for every 10 liters of water for 2 weeks.</li><li>Store in a cool, dry place.</li><li><b style=\"font-weight:bolder;\"><strong>Best Before : 2 Years from the Mfd Date</strong></b></li></ul>', '', 'published', '[\"sunken-garden-stop-worms-200ml-30ml-min.jpg\"]', NULL, NULL, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 9, 0, 0, 490, 441, NULL, NULL, 0.00, 0.00, 0.00, 0.00, 0, 8, '2024-09-12 02:23:20', '2024-10-04 17:41:51', 'in_stock', 3, 'Botble\\ACL\\Models\\User', 'sunken-garden-stop-worms-200ml-30ml-min.jpg', 'physical', NULL, NULL, 0, 0, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, 0),
(369, 'Sunken Garden Tropical Fish Water Conditioner 100Ml', '<p style=\"background-color:rgb(255,255,255);color:rgb(105,105,105);font-family:Poppins, sans-serif;font-size:16px;font-style:normal;font-weight:400;word-spacing:0px;\">Unlock the full vibrancy and vitality of your lively barb community with Sunken Garden Barbs Conditioner. Exquisitely tailored to meet the unique needs of barbs, this conditioner recreates their natural habitat, ensuring their health, happiness, and the captivating beauty that these fish bring to your aquarium.</p><p style=\"background-color:rgb(255,255,255);color:rgb(105,105,105);font-family:Poppins, sans-serif;font-size:16px;font-style:normal;font-weight:400;word-spacing:0px;\"> </p><p style=\"background-color:rgb(255,255,255);color:rgb(105,105,105);font-family:Poppins, sans-serif;font-size:16px;font-style:normal;font-weight:400;word-spacing:0px;\"><strong style=\"font-weight:bolder;\">        Benefits:</strong></p><ol><li>pH Reducer: Sunken Garden Barbs Conditioner expertly lowers and stabilizes pH levels, replicating the slightly acidic and soft water conditions preferred by barbs. Transform your aquarium into an authentic representation of their native environment.</li><li>Chlorine Neutralizer: Instantly neutralizes harmful chlorine and chloramines from tap water, safeguarding your barbs from stress and potential health issues. Create a safe and serene aquatic haven for your dynamic barb community.</li><li>Beneficial Bacteria Booster: Enriched with specialized strains of beneficial bacteria, this conditioner supports a healthy nitrogen cycle in your aquarium. These microorganisms actively reduce ammonia and nitrite levels, promoting a balanced and thriving ecosystem.</li><li>Stress Relief: Sunken Garden Barbs Conditioner is thoughtfully formulated to keep your barbs stress-free and content. By reducing stress, it enhances overall well-being and vitality, allowing your barbs to flourish in their natural-inspired environment.</li><li>Parasite Prevention: Protect your barb community from common aquatic pests, including anchor worms, flukes, and lice. Our conditioner creates a protective shield, ensuring a pest-free and secure aquatic environment.</li></ol><p style=\"background-color:rgb(255,255,255);color:rgb(105,105,105);font-family:Poppins, sans-serif;font-size:16px;font-style:normal;font-weight:400;word-spacing:0px;\"><strong style=\"font-weight:bolder;\"> </strong></p><p style=\"background-color:rgb(255,255,255);color:rgb(105,105,105);font-family:Poppins, sans-serif;font-size:16px;font-style:normal;font-weight:400;word-spacing:0px;\"><strong style=\"font-weight:bolder;\">Directions for use:</strong></p><ul><li>Shake well before use.</li><li>Add 1ml for every 5 litres of water.</li><li>Overdosing does not affect aquatic life.</li><li>Store in a cool, dry place.</li></ul>', '', 'published', '[\"untitled-design223-min.png\"]', NULL, NULL, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 9, 0, 0, 490, 441, NULL, NULL, 0.00, 0.00, 0.00, 0.00, 0, 5, '2024-09-12 02:24:48', '2024-10-04 17:41:35', 'in_stock', 3, 'Botble\\ACL\\Models\\User', 'untitled-design223-min.png', 'physical', NULL, NULL, 0, 0, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, 0),
