n\\nAntarctic krill for added flavour &amp; palatability&quot;}\" data-sheets-root=\"1\">– No artificial colours or additives</span><br><span style=\"box-sizing:border-box;\" data-sheets-userformat=\"{&quot;2&quot;:9151,&quot;3&quot;:{&quot;1&quot;:0},&quot;4&quot;:{&quot;1&quot;:2,&quot;2&quot;:16776960},&quot;5&quot;:{&quot;1&quot;:[{&quot;1&quot;:2,&quot;2&quot;:0,&quot;5&quot;:{&quot;1&quot;:2,&quot;2&quot;:0}},{&quot;1&quot;:0,&quot;2&quot;:0,&quot;3&quot;:3},{&quot;1&quot;:1,&quot;2&quot;:0,&quot;4&quot;:1}]},&quot;6&quot;:{&quot;1&quot;:[{&quot;1&quot;:2,&quot;2&quot;:0,&quot;5&quot;:{&quot;1&quot;:2,&quot;2&quot;:0}},{&quot;1&quot;:0,&quot;2&quot;:0,&quot;3&quot;:3},{&quot;1&quot;:1,&quot;2&quot;:0,&quot;4&quot;:1}]},&quot;7&quot;:{&quot;1&quot;:[{&quot;1&quot;:2,&quot;2&quot;:0,&quot;5&quot;:{&quot;1&quot;:2,&quot;2&quot;:0}},{&quot;1&quot;:0,&quot;2&quot;:0,&quot;3&quot;:3},{&quot;1&quot;:1,&quot;2&quot;:0,&quot;4&quot;:1}]},&quot;8&quot;:{&quot;1&quot;:[{&quot;1&quot;:2,&quot;2&quot;:0,&quot;5&quot;:{&quot;1&quot;:2,&quot;2&quot;:0}},{&quot;1&quot;:0,&quot;2&quot;:0,&quot;3&quot;:3},{&quot;1&quot;:1,&quot;2&quot;:0,&quot;4&quot;:1}]},&quot;10&quot;:1,&quot;11&quot;:4,&quot;12&quot;:0,&quot;16&quot;:8}\" data-sheets-value=\"{&quot;1&quot;:2,&quot;2&quot;:&quot;Intan Goldfish Pellets (Big Floating Pellets), a highly nutritious Ornamental Fish Food with 42% protein, are specially formulated for all varieties of Goldfish, including Ryukin, Red Cap, Ranchu, &amp; Lionhead. These pellets are made with highly nutritious ingredients to ensure maximum intake &amp; nutrient absorption while minimizing water pollution. Recognizing that Goldfish prefer natural foods like water plants, the formula includes algae &amp; yeast as suitable alternatives.\\n\\nA special combination of ingredients, balanced to meet the specific nutritional needs of Goldfish\\n\\nContains beta-carotene &amp; paprika for boosting the natural colours\\n\\nNo artificial colours or additives\\n\\nAntarctic krill for added flavour &amp; palatability&quot;}\" data-sheets-root=\"1\">– Antarctic krill for added flavour &amp; palatability.</span></p></div>', NULL),
('bn_BD', 106, 'Intan Guppy Pellets Medium 60 gm', '<p style=\"-webkit-text-stroke-width:0px;box-sizing:border-box;color:rgb(105, 105, 105);font-family:Poppins, sans-serif;font-size:16px;font-style:normal;font-variant-caps:normal;font-variant-ligatures:normal;font-weight:400;letter-spacing:normal;margin-block:0px 0.9rem;orphans:2;text-align:start;text-decoration-color:initial;text-decoration-style:initial;text-decoration-thickness:initial;text-indent:0px;text-transform:none;white-space:normal;widows:2;word-spacing:0px;\">Intan Guppy Pellets (Floating Pellets), a Highly Nutritious Ornamental Fish Food with 40% protein, are specially formulated for different varieties of Guppies &amp; small surface-eating fish to match their natural diet. These pellets are made from high-quality ingredients of both plant &amp; animal origin, blended together to provide wholesome nutrition that is easily digestible by their short digestive tracts. Considering that guppies have small, upward-shaped mouths, the small size of our pellets makes them easy for these fish to consume.</p><p style=\"-webkit-text-stroke-width:0px;box-sizing:border-box;color:rgb(105, 105, 105);font-family:Poppins, sans-serif;font-size:16px;font-style:normal;font-variant-caps:normal;font-variant-ligatures:normal;font-weight:400;letter-spacing:normal;margin-block:0px 0.9rem;orphans:2;text-align:start;text-decoration-color:initial;text-decoration-style:initial;text-decoration-thickness:initial;text-indent:0px;text-transform:none;white-space:normal;widows:2;word-spacing:0px;\">Scientifically formulated diet for promoting vitality, digestibility &amp; immunity<br>– Added Astaxanthin from natural ingredients to enhance their vivid colours<br>– The small size of our guppy pellets enables ease of intake<br>– An omnivorous diet with a balanced mix of animal &amp; plant protein</p>', NULL),
('bn_BD', 107, 'Intan Herbivore Wafers (Big)190gm', '<p><span style=\"background-color:rgb(255,255,255);color:rgb(105,105,105);font-size:16px;\"><span>Intan Herbivore Wafers (Big Sinking Wafers), a Highly Nutritious Ornamental Fish Food with 30% protein, are specially crafted for all herbivorous fish, including Mollies, Mbunas &amp; Plecos. These wafers are made with the finest quality leafy greens &amp; sustainably sourced vegetables. Containing high levels of fiber &amp; multivitamins, they promote excellent digestion, reduce inflammation, &amp; strengthen the immune system. Additionally, the high level of spirulina in the feed provides significant amounts of antioxidant pigments, such as phycocyanin &amp; carotenoids, enhancing the fishes’ colour &amp; increasing their nutrient absorption. High levels of Spirulina</span></span><br><span style=\"background-color:rgb(255,255,255);color:rgb(105,105,105);font-size:16px;\"><span>– Excellent feed intake &amp; digestibility</span></span><br><span style=\"background-color:rgb(255,255,255);color:rgb(105,105,105);font-size:16px;\"><span>– 100% vegetarian food</span></span><br><span style=\"background-color:rgb(255,255,255);color:rgb(105,105,105);font-size:16px;\"><span>– Uniquely formulated herbivore diet blended using high-quality mixed vegetables</span></span><br><span style=\"background-color:rgb(255,255,255);color:rgb(105,105,105);font-size:16px;\"><span>– Low water turbidity</span></span></p>', NULL),
('bn_BD', 108, 'Intan Micro Bits large (140gm)', '<p style=\"-webkit-text-stroke-width:0px;box-sizing:border-box;color:rgb(105, 105, 105);font-family:Poppins, sans-serif;font-size:16px;font-style:normal;font-variant-caps:normal;font-variant-ligatures:normal;font-weight:400;letter-spacing:normal;margin-block:0px 0.9rem;orphans:2;text-align:start;text-decoration-color:initial;text-decoration-style:initial;text-decoration-thickness:initial;text-indent:0px;text-transform:none;white-space:normal;widows:2;word-spacing:0px;\">Slowly Sinking Crumble&nbsp;– Dia 0.4mm</p><ul><li>High water stability</li><li>Addition of garlic as an immunostimulant</li><li>High Palatability</li><li>Antartic krill for added nutrition and flavor</li><li>Ideal for small mouth fish</li></ul><div class=\"suitable-text\" style=\"-webkit-text-stroke-width:0px;box-sizing:border-box;color:rgb(105, 105, 105);font-family:Poppins, sans-serif;font-size:16px;font-style:normal;font-variant-caps:normal;font-variant-ligatures:normal;font-weight:400;letter-spacing:normal;orphans:2;text-align:start;text-decoration-color:initial;text-decoration-style:initial;text-decoration-thickness:initial;text-indent:0px;text-transform:none;white-space:normal;widows:2;word-spacing:0px;\">Suitable for fish with small mouths like Killifish, Tetras, Rasboras, Danios etc</div>', NULL),
('bn_BD', 109, 'Intan Micro Bits medium (50gm)', '<p style=\"-webkit-text-stroke-width:0px;box-sizing:border-box;color:rgb(105, 105, 105);font-family:Poppins, sans-serif;font-size:16px;font-style:normal;font-variant-caps:normal;font-variant-ligatures:normal;font-weight:400;letter-spacing:normal;margin-block:0px 0.9rem;orphans:2;text-align:start;text-decoration-color:initial;text-decoration-style:initial;text-decoration-thickness:initial;text-indent:0px;text-transform:none;white-space:normal;widows:2;word-spacing:0px;\">Slowly Sinking Crumble&nbsp;– Dia 0.4mm</p><ul><li>High water stability</li><li>Addition of garlic as an immunostimulant</li><li>High Palatability</li><li>Antartic krill for added nutrition and flavor</li><li>Ideal for small mouth fish</li></ul><div class=\"suitable-text\" style=\"-webkit-text-stroke-width:0px;box-sizing:border-box;color:rgb(105, 105, 105);font-family:Poppins, sans-serif;font-size:16px;font-style:normal;font-variant-caps:normal;font-variant-ligatures:normal;font-weight:400;letter-spacing:normal;orphans:2;text-align:start;text-decoration-color:initial;text-decoration-style:initial;text-decoration-thickness:initial;text-indent:0px;text-transform:none;white-space:normal;widows:2;word-spacing:0px;\">Suitable for fish with small mouths like Killifish, Tetras, Rasboras, Danios etc</div>', NULL);
