('bn_BD', 112, 'Intan Red Enhance Pellets (Small) 140gm', '<div class=\"product__description rte quick-add-hidden\" style=\"-webkit-text-stroke-width:0px;box-sizing:border-box;color:rgb(105, 105, 105);font-family:Poppins, sans-serif;font-size:16px;font-style:normal;font-variant-caps:normal;font-variant-ligatures:normal;font-weight:400;letter-spacing:normal;orphans:2;text-align:start;text-decoration-color:initial;text-decoration-style:initial;text-decoration-thickness:initial;text-indent:0px;text-transform:none;white-space:normal;widows:2;word-spacing:0px;\"><p style=\"box-sizing:border-box;margin-block:0px 0.9rem;\"><span style=\"box-sizing:border-box;\" data-sheets-userformat=\"{&quot;2&quot;:9151,&quot;3&quot;:{&quot;1&quot;:0},&quot;4&quot;:{&quot;1&quot;:2,&quot;2&quot;:16776960},&quot;5&quot;:{&quot;1&quot;:[{&quot;1&quot;:2,&quot;2&quot;:0,&quot;5&quot;:{&quot;1&quot;:2,&quot;2&quot;:0}},{&quot;1&quot;:0,&quot;2&quot;:0,&quot;3&quot;:3},{&quot;1&quot;:1,&quot;2&quot;:0,&quot;4&quot;:1}]},&quot;6&quot;:{&quot;1&quot;:[{&quot;1&quot;:2,&quot;2&quot;:0,&quot;5&quot;:{&quot;1&quot;:2,&quot;2&quot;:0}},{&quot;1&quot;:0,&quot;2&quot;:0,&quot;3&quot;:3},{&quot;1&quot;:1,&quot;2&quot;:0,&quot;4&quot;:1}]},&quot;7&quot;:{&quot;1&quot;:[{&quot;1&quot;:2,&quot;2&quot;:0,&quot;5&quot;:{&quot;1&quot;:2,&quot;2&quot;:0}},{&quot;1&quot;:0,&quot;2&quot;:0,&quot;3&quot;:3},{&quot;1&quot;:1,&quot;2&quot;:0,&quot;4&quot;:1}]},&quot;8&quot;:{&quot;1&quot;:[{&quot;1&quot;:2,&quot;2&quot;:0,&quot;5&quot;:{&quot;1&quot;:2,&quot;2&quot;:0}},{&quot;1&quot;:0,&quot;2&quot;:0,&quot;3&quot;:3},{&quot;1&quot;:1,&quot;2&quot;:0,&quot;4&quot;:1}]},&quot;10&quot;:1,&quot;11&quot;:4,&quot;12&quot;:0,&quot;16&quot;:8}\" data-sheets-value=\"{&quot;1&quot;:2,&quot;2&quot;:&quot;Intan Red Enhance Pellets (Small Floating Pellets), a highly Nutritious Ornamental Fish Food with 40% protein, are specifically formulated for Parrotfish &amp; other red-coloured fish. This balanced diet is designed to intensify the red pigmentation in fish, achieved through the addition of natural Astaxanthin &amp; de-seeded Kashmiri chilies. The wholesome nutrition provided by these pellets promotes healthy feed intake, enhanced digestibility, &amp; disease resistance.\\n\\nAstaxanthin &amp; paprika contribute to the intense red colour of the fish\\n\\nA wholesome nutritious blend of natural ingredients\\n\\nNatural colour-enhancing diet\\n\\nNo pollution of the tank water\\n\\nHigh digestibility &amp; palatability&quot;}\" data-sheets-root=\"1\">Intan Red Enhance Pellets (Small Floating Pellets), a Highly Nutritious Ornamental Fish Food with 40% protein, are specifically formulated for Parrotfish &amp; other red-coloured fish. This balanced diet is designed to intensify the red pigmentation in fish, achieved through the addition of natural Astaxanthin &amp; de-seeded Kashmiri chilies. The wholesome nutrition provided by these pellets promotes healthy feed intake, enhanced digestibility, &amp; disease resistance.</span></p><p style=\"box-sizing:border-box;margin-block:0px 0.9rem;\">– Astaxanthin &amp; paprika contribute to the intense red colour of the fish<br>– A wholesome nutritious blend of natural ingredients<br>– Natural colour-enhancing diet<br>– No pollution of the tank water<br>– High digestibility &amp; palatability.</p></div><p><br>&nbsp;</p>', NULL),
