('bn_BD', 123, 'Life Aayuh Cichlid Regular Fish Feed 100g', '<p><span style=\"background-color:rgb(255,255,255);color:rgb(105,105,105);font-size:16px;\"><span>Life Aayuh Cichlid feed is immunity booster &amp; digestion friendly for all types cichlid fishes</span></span><br><span style=\"background-color:rgb(255,255,255);color:rgb(105,105,105);font-size:16px;\"><span>Natural</span></span><br><span style=\"background-color:rgb(255,255,255);color:rgb(105,105,105);font-size:16px;\"><span>Handmade</span></span><br><span style=\"background-color:rgb(255,255,255);color:rgb(105,105,105);font-size:16px;\"><span>Immunity Booster</span></span><br><span style=\"background-color:rgb(255,255,255);color:rgb(105,105,105);font-size:16px;\"><span>Ayurvedic Ingredients</span></span><br><span style=\"background-color:rgb(255,255,255);color:rgb(105,105,105);font-size:16px;\"><span>Clinically proven content</span></span></p>', NULL),
('bn_BD', 124, 'Alternanthera Reineckii mini', '<p>Dwarf form of Alternanthera Reineckii that grows low. Suitable for dutch and nano tanks.</p><p>Plant Difficulty : Medium</p><p>Light Requirement : Very Bright</p><p>Plant Type : &nbsp;Stem</p>', NULL),
('bn_BD', 125, 'Life Aayuh Flowerhorn Feed Medium 100g', '<p><span style=\"background-color:rgb(255,255,255);color:rgb(105,105,105);font-size:16px;\"><span>For MEDIUM size flowerhorn fish up to 3 to 6 inches .</span></span><br><span style=\"background-color:rgb(255,255,255);color:rgb(105,105,105);font-size:16px;\"><span>Included Papaya Lead and Gooseberry Extract ,Red Paprika Extract for Health and Color and Life and Longevity Contains is Tulsi Extract.</span></span></p>', NULL),
('bn_BD', 126, 'Alternanthera Reineckii Mini Growow Tc', '<p>Description: Alternanthera reineckii ‘Mini’ is a diminutive and captivating aquatic plant that adds a touch of vibrant color to aquariums. As a cultivar of the popular Alternanthera reineckii, this mini variant offers alluring foliage in a compact size, making it an excellent choice for aquascaping. Originating from South America, this plant belongs to the amaranth family (Amaranthaceae) and is cherished for its rich red and pink hues.</p><p>The ‘Mini’ variant maintains the signature lance-shaped leaves of its parent species but on a smaller scale. The leaves exhibit a spectrum of colors, ranging from green to deep red or pink, depending on the aquarium conditions. Its compact growth and vivid colors make ‘Mini’ a versatile plant suitable for foregrounds, borders, or small spaces within the aquascape.</p><p>Plant Information:</p><p>Scientific Name: Alternanthera reineckii ‘Mini’<br>Common Names: Mini Alternanthera, AR ‘Mini’<br>Family: Amaranthaceae<br>Origin: South America<br>Difficulty Level: Moderate<br>Lighting Requirements: Medium to High<br>CO2 Requirement: Beneficial for enhanced growth<br>Temperature Range: 72-82°F (22-28°C)<br>pH Range: 6.0-7.0<br>Propagation: Cuttings, side shoots</p>', NULL),
('bn_BD', 127, 'Life Aayuh Food Baby Bites | 30gm', '<p><span style=\"background-color:rgb(255,255,255);color:rgb(105,105,105);font-size:16px;\"><span>Fish meal, Anchovies, Shrimp meal, Yeast extract, Wheat extract, Soy protein isolate, Fish oil, Whole eggs, Vitamin E supplement (1000 iu / kg ) Vitamin B12 complex (2000 iu / kg ), Vitamin A (15000 iu / kg ), coated and stabilised Vitamin C&nbsp;( 950 mg / kg ), Cod liver oil, Vegetable oil, permitted grade a preservatives and antioxidants. Added blend of intestinal enzymes, pancreatic enzymes and salivary enzymes to support the developing digestive system and overall growth of baby fish. </span></span><strong style=\"-webkit-text-stroke-width:0px;background-color:rgb(255, 255, 255);box-sizing:border-box;color:rgb(105, 105, 105);font-family:Poppins, sans-serif;font-size:16px;font-style:normal;font-variant-caps:normal;font-variant-ligatures:normal;font-weight:bolder;letter-spacing:normal;orphans:2;text-align:start;text-decoration-color:initial;text-decoration-style:initial;text-decoration-thickness:initial;text-indent:0px;text-transform:none;white-space:normal;widows:2;word-spacing:0px;\">FEEDING:</strong><span style=\"background-color:rgb(255,255,255);color:rgb(105,105,105);font-size:16px;\"><span> Limited Quantity ( 0.5 gram for 100 baby fish), 4 – 5 times a day.</span></span></p>', NULL),
('bn_BD', 128, 'Life Aayuh Food Tropical Treats – Large | 70gm', '<ul><li>Immunity Booster</li><li>Handmade</li><li>Natural Source</li><li>Ayurvedic Ingredients</li><li>Clinically Proven Content</li></ul><p style=\"-webkit-text-stroke-width:0px;box-sizing:border-box;color:rgb(105, 105, 105);font-family:Poppins, sans-serif;font-size:16px;font-style:normal;font-variant-caps:normal;font-variant-ligatures:normal;font-weight:400;letter-spacing:normal;margin-block:0px 0.9rem;orphans:2;text-align:start;text-decoration-color:initial;text-decoration-style:initial;text-decoration-thickness:initial;text-indent:0px;text-transform:none;white-space:normal;widows:2;word-spacing:0px;\"><strong style=\"box-sizing:border-box;font-weight:bolder;\">Ingredients:</strong></p><p style=\"-webkit-text-stroke-width:0px;box-sizing:border-box;color:rgb(105, 105, 105);font-family:Poppins, sans-serif;font-size:16px;font-style:normal;font-variant-caps:normal;font-variant-ligatures:normal;font-weight:400;letter-spacing:normal;margin-block:0px 0.9rem;orphans:2;text-align:start;text-decoration-color:initial;text-decoration-style:initial;text-decoration-thickness:initial;text-indent:0px;text-transform:none;white-space:normal;widows:2;word-spacing:0px;\">Fish Meal, Anchovies, Shrimp Meal, Yeast Extract, Wheat Extract, Soy Protein Isolate, Fish Oil, Whole Eggs, Vitamin E Supplement, Vitamin B12 Complex, Vitamin a, Coated and Stabilised Vitamin C, Cod Liver Oil, Vegetable Oil, Permitted Grade a Preservatives and Antioxidants, Asthaxanthin, Paprika, Lutein 10%, Spirulina, Sea Weed Extract, Garlic Extract, Moringa.</p><p style=\"-webkit-text-stroke-width:0px;box-sizing:border-box;color:rgb(105, 105, 105);font-family:Poppins, sans-serif;font-size:16px;font-style:normal;font-variant-caps:normal;font-variant-ligatures:normal;font-weight:400;letter-spacing:normal;margin-block:0px 0.9rem;orphans:2;text-align:start;text-decoration-color:initial;text-decoration-style:initial;text-decoration-thickness:initial;tex