('bn_BD', 130, 'Alternanthera Reineckii Rosenervig', '<p>This plant has pink leaves with white colored veins. Grows compact under very high light. CO2 and nutrient dosing is required.</p><p>Plant Difficulty : Medium</p><p>Light Requirement : Very Bright</p><p>Plant Type : Stem</p>', NULL),
