('bn_BD', 132, 'Alternanthera Reineckii Rosenervig Growow Tc', '<p>Description: Alternanthera reineckii “Rosanervig” is a captivating and vibrant aquatic plant known for its distinctive pink and red hues. Belonging to the amaranth family (Amaranthaceae), this cultivar is a variation of the popular Alternanthera reineckii. Originating from South America, “Rosanervig” stands out with its striking coloration, making it a sought-after choice for aquascaping enthusiasts.</p><p>The plant’s leaves are lance-shaped and exhibit a unique blend of green and intense pink or red pigmentation. The undersides of the leaves often feature a contrasting pinkish color, creating a visually appealing effect. Under optimal conditions, the plant can develop a lush and bushy appearance, making it an excellent choice for adding depth and contrast to aquarium layouts.</p><p>Plant Information:</p><p>Scientific Name: Alternanthera reineckii “Rosanervig”<br>Common Names: Pink Alternanthera, AR “Rosanervig”<br>Family: Amaranthaceae<br>Origin: South America<br>Difficulty Level: Moderate to Advanced<br>Lighting Requirements: Medium to High<br>CO2 Requirement: Beneficial for enhanced growth<br>Temperature Range: 72-82°F (22-28°C)<br>pH Range: 6.0-7.0<br>Propagation: Cuttings, side shoots</p>', NULL),
('bn_BD', 133, 'Ammania Senegalensis', '<p>This plant can tolerate high temperature. CO2 and nutrients are required for the plant to become orange red.</p><p>Plant Difficulty : Medium</p><p>Light Requirement : Very Bright</p><p>Plant Type : Stem</p>', NULL),
('bn_BD', 134, 'Life Aayuh Food Tropical Treats – Small | 70gm', '<ul><li>Immunity Booster</li><li>Handmade</li><li>Natural Source</li><li>Ayurvedic Ingredients</li><li>Clinically Proven Content</li></ul><p style=\"-webkit-text-stroke-width:0px;box-sizing:border-box;color:rgb(105, 105, 105);font-family:Poppins, sans-serif;font-size:16px;font-style:normal;font-variant-caps:normal;font-variant-ligatures:normal;font-weight:400;letter-spacing:normal;margin-block:0px 0.9rem;orphans:2;text-align:start;text-decoration-color:initial;text-decoration-style:initial;text-decoration-thickness:initial;text-indent:0px;text-transform:none;white-space:normal;widows:2;word-spacing:0px;\"><strong style=\"box-sizing:border-box;font-weight:bolder;\">Ingredients:</strong></p><p style=\"-webkit-text-stroke-width:0px;box-sizing:border-box;color:rgb(105, 105, 105);font-family:Poppins, sans-serif;font-size:16px;font-style:normal;font-variant-caps:normal;font-variant-ligatures:normal;font-weight:400;letter-spacing:normal;margin-block:0px 0.9rem;orphans:2;text-align:start;text-decoration-color:initial;text-decoration-style:initial;text-decoration-thickness:initial;text-indent:0px;text-transform:none;white-space:normal;widows:2;word-spacing:0px;\">Fish Meal, Anchovies, Shrimp Meal, Yeast Extract, Wheat Extract, Soy Protein Isolate, Fish Oil, Whole Eggs, Vitamin E Supplement, Vitamin B12 Complex, Vitamin a, Coated and Stabilised Vitamin C, Cod Liver Oil, Vegetable Oil, Permitted Grade a Preservatives and Antioxidants, Asthaxanthin, Paprika, Lutein 10%, Spirulina, Sea Weed Extract, Garlic Extract, Moringa</p>', NULL),
