 can consume in 2-3 minutes.<br>always remove uneaten food.<br>Quantity varies on the size and variety of the fish.</p>', NULL),
('bn_BD', 137, 'Life Aayuh Koi Regular Fish Feed 500gm', '<p style=\"-webkit-text-stroke-width:0px;box-sizing:border-box;color:rgb(105, 105, 105);font-family:Poppins, sans-serif;font-size:16px;font-style:normal;font-variant-caps:normal;font-variant-ligatures:normal;font-weight:400;letter-spacing:normal;margin-block:0px 0.9rem;orphans:2;text-align:start;text-decoration-color:initial;text-decoration-style:initial;text-decoration-thickness:initial;text-indent:0px;text-transform:none;white-space:normal;widows:2;word-spacing:0px;\"><strong style=\"box-sizing:border-box;font-weight:bolder;\">Designed For INDIAN Breeds, Improves Growth And Colour.</strong></p><p style=\"-webkit-text-stroke-width:0px;box-sizing:border-box;color:rgb(105, 105, 105);font-family:Poppins, sans-serif;font-size:16px;font-style:normal;font-variant-caps:normal;font-variant-ligatures:normal;font-weight:400;letter-spacing:normal;margin-block:0px 0.9rem;orphans:2;text-align:start;text-decoration-color:initial;text-decoration-style:initial;text-decoration-thickness:initial;text-indent:0px;text-transform:none;white-space:normal;widows:2;word-spacing:0px;\"><strong style=\"box-sizing:border-box;font-weight:bolder;\">Life-Aayuh Koi Fish Feed- Floating Pellets</strong><br>-Handmade<br>-Immunity Booster<br>-Clinically Proven Content<br>-Ayurvedic Ingredients<br>-Natural</p><p style=\"-webkit-text-stroke-width:0px;box-sizing:border-box;color:rgb(105, 105, 105);font-family:Poppins, sans-serif;font-size:16px;font-style:normal;font-variant-caps:normal;font-variant-ligatures:normal;font-weight:400;letter-spacing:normal;margin-block:0px 0.9rem;orphans:2;text-align:start;text-decoration-color:initial;text-decoration-style:initial;text-decoration-thickness:initial;text-indent:0px;text-transform:none;white-space:normal;widows:2;word-spacing:0px;\"><strong style=\"box-sizing:border-box;font-weight:bolder;\">FEEDING</strong><br>One fish 2 times a day, approximately Four Pellets ,feed as much as the fish can consume in 2-3 minutes.<br>always remove uneaten food.<br>Quantity varies on the size and variety of the fish .</p>', NULL),
('bn_BD', 138, 'Life Aayuh Red Large Fish Feed 100g', '<p style=\"-webkit-text-stroke-width:0px;box-sizing:border-box;color:rgb(105, 105, 105);font-family:Poppins, sans-serif;font-size:16px;font-style:normal;font-variant-caps:normal;font-variant-ligatures:normal;font-weight:400;letter-spacing:normal;margin-block:0px 0.9rem;orphans:2;text-align:start;text-decoration-color:initial;text-decoration-style:initial;text-decoration-thickness:initial;text-indent:0px;text-transform:none;white-space:normal;widows:2;word-spacing:0px;\">• This fish feed is particularly for all the LARGE fish which can be included in everyday diet of your fish. It works as an Immunity booster.<br>• This Fish feed is hand made having natural as well as Ayurvedic ingredients.<br>• It has clinically proven content.<br>• This fish feed is digestion friendly and keeps the water clean.</p><p style=\"-webkit-text-stroke-width:0px;box-sizing:border-box;color:rgb(105, 105, 105);font-family:Poppins, sans-serif;font-size:16px;font-style:normal;font-variant-caps:normal;font-variant-ligatures:normal;font-weight:400;letter-spacing:normal;margin-block:0px 0.9rem;orphans:2;text-align:start;text-decoration-color:initial;text-decoration-style:initial;text-decoration-thickness:initial;text-indent:0px;text-transform:none;white-space:normal;widows:2;word-spacing:0px;\">USAGE:<br>• 1,2 ka 4 formula, ONE FISH TWO TIMES A DAY,APPROXIMATELY FOUR PELLETS.<br>• Feed as much as the fish can consume in 2-3 minutes.<br>• Always remove uneaten feed, quantity varies on the size and variety of the fish.</p>', NULL),
