('bn_BD', 145, 'WA Arowana Nutri Sticks | 500ml – 200g', '<p style=\"-webkit-text-stroke-width:0px;background-color:rgb(255, 255, 255);box-sizing:border-box;color:rgb(105, 105, 105);font-family:Poppins, sans-serif;font-size:16px;font-style:normal;font-variant-caps:normal;font-variant-ligatures:normal;font-weight:400;letter-spacing:normal;margin-block:0px 0.9rem;orphans:2;text-align:start;text-decoration-color:initial;text-decoration-style:initial;text-decoration-thickness:initial;text-indent:0px;text-transform:none;white-space:normal;widows:2;word-spacing:0px;\"><strong style=\"box-sizing:border-box;font-weight:bolder;\">WA Arowana Nutri Sticks | 500ml – 200g</strong></p><p style=\"-webkit-text-stroke-width:0px;background-color:rgb(255, 255, 255);box-sizing:border-box;color:rgb(105, 105, 105);font-family:Poppins, sans-serif;font-size:16px;font-style:normal;font-variant-caps:normal;font-variant-ligatures:normal;font-weight:400;letter-spacing:normal;margin-block:0px 0.9rem;orphans:2;text-align:start;text-decoration-color:initial;text-decoration-style:initial;text-decoration-thickness:initial;text-indent:0px;text-transform:none;white-space:normal;widows:2;word-spacing:0px;\">WA Arowana Nutri Sticks is the complete nutrition for Arowana fish in sticks shaped feed. With added color enhancers for the vibrant color sheen naturally.</p><h4 style=\"-webkit-text-stroke-width:0px;background-color:rgb(255, 255, 255);box-sizing:border-box;color:var( --e-global-color-secondary );font-family:var( --e-global-typography-83682a1-font-family ), Sans-serif;font-size:var( --e-global-typography-83682a1-font-size );font-style:normal;font-variant-caps:normal;font-variant-ligatures:normal;font-weight:var( --e-global-typography-83682a1-font-weight );letter-spacing:normal;line-height:var( --e-global-typography-83682a1-line-height );margin-block:0.5rem 1rem;orphans:2;text-align:start;text-decoration-color:initial;text-decoration-style:initial;text-decoration-thickness:initial;text-indent:0px;text-transform:none;white-space:normal;widows:2;word-spacing:0px;\"><strong style=\"box-sizing:border-box;font-weight:bolder;\">Ingredients</strong></h4><p style=\"-webkit-text-stroke-width:0px;background-color:rgb(255, 255, 255);box-sizing:border-box;color:rgb(105, 105, 105);font-family:Poppins, sans-serif;font-size:16px;font-style:normal;font-variant-caps:normal;font-variant-ligatures:normal;font-weight:400;letter-spacing:normal;margin-block:0px 0.9rem;orphans:2;text-align:start;text-decoration-color:initial;text-decoration-style:initial;text-decoration-thickness:initial;text-indent:0px;text-transform:none;white-space:normal;widows:2;word-spacing:0px;\">Fish meal, Soy bean meal, Fish hydrolysate, marigold extract, Krill meal, shrimp meal, Soy-<br>lecithin, Fish oil, Astaxanthine, Phycocyanin, Beta-Carotene, Spirulina, Yeast powder, Vitamin A, D, E , K &amp; C, Vitamin B complex, Trace minerals (Cu, Na, Fe, I, Mn, Co, Zn &amp; Se), Amino acids (18 types), and Essential fatty acids.</p><h4 style=\"-webkit-text-stroke-width:0px;background-color:rgb(255, 255, 255);box-sizing:border-box;color:var( --e-global-color-secondary );font-family:var( --e-global-typography-83682a1-font-family ), Sans-serif;font-size:var( --e-global-typography-83682a1-font-size );font-style:normal;font-variant-caps:normal;font-variant-ligatures:normal;font-weight:var( --e-global-typography-83682a1-font-weight );letter-spacing:normal;line-height:var( --e-global-typography-83682a1-line-height );margin-block:0.5rem 1rem;orphans:2;text-align:start;text-decoration-color:initial;text-decoration-style:initial;text-decoration-thickness:initial;text-indent:0px;text-transform:none;white-space:normal;widows:2;word-spacing:0px;\"><strong style=\"box-sizing:border-box;font-weight:bolder;\">Instruction</strong></h4><p style=\"-webkit-text-stroke-width:0px;background-color:rgb(255, 255, 255);box-sizing:border-box;color:rgb(105, 105, 105);font-family:Poppins, sans-serif;font-size:16px;font-style:normal;font-variant-caps:normal;font-variant-ligatures:normal;font-weight:400;letter-spacing:normal;margin-block:0px 0.9rem;orphans:2;text-align:start;text-decoration-color:initial;text-decoration-style:initial;text-decoration-thickness:initial;text-indent:0px;text-transform:none;white-space:normal;widows:2;word-spacing:0px;\">Feed twice a day. Remove uneaten feed. Not for human consumption. Keep out of reach of children. Keep at room temperature.</p><p style=\"-webkit-text-stroke-width:0px;background-color:rgb(255, 255, 255);box-sizing:border-box;color:rgb(105, 105, 105);font-family:Poppins, sans-serif;font-size:16px;font-style:normal;font-variant-caps:normal;font-variant-ligatures:normal;font-weight:400;letter-spacing:normal;margin-block:0px 0.9rem;orphans:2;text-align:start;text-decoration-color:initial;text-decoration-style:initial;text-decoration-thickness:initial;text-indent:0px;text-transform:none;white-space:normal;widows:2;word-spacing:0px;\">Arowana fish may not accept the fish feed during introduction of this feed, if fed with live fish or any<br>other feed. Kindly starve the fish and try feeding everyday until it acclimatize to the new feed.</p><h4 style=\"-webkit-text-stroke-width:0px;background-color:rgb(255, 255, 255);box-sizing:border-box;color:var( --e-global-color-secondary );font-family:var( --e-global-typography-83682a1-font-family ), Sans-serif;font-size:var( --e-global-typography-83682a1-font-size );font-style:normal;font-variant-caps:normal;font-variant-ligatures:normal;font-weight:var( --e-global-typography-83682a1-font-weight );letter-spacing:normal;line-height:var( --e-global-typography-83682a1-line-height );margin-block:0.5rem 1rem;orphans:2;text-align:start;text-decoration-color:initial;text-decoration-style:initial;text-decoration-thickness:initial;text-indent:0px;text-transform:none;white-space:normal;widows:2;word-spacing:0px;\"><strong style=\"box-sizing:border-box;font-weight:bolder;\">Nutritional Fact</strong></h4><ul><li>Protein – 46%</li><li>Fat – 6%</li><li>Fiber – 4%</li><li>Moisture – 9%</li></ul>', NULL),
('bn_BD', 146, 'Anubias Petite', '<p>Description: Anubias Nana ‘Petite’ is a charming and diminutive variant within the Anubias Nana species, prized for its small size and delicate appearance. Belonging to the Araceae family and native to West Africa, this aquatic plant showcases the classic heart-shaped leaves characteristic of the Anubias genus but on a smaller scale. The ‘Petite’ variation is ideal for nano aquariums or as a foreground plant in larger setups, providing aquarists with an opportunity to introduce elegance to even the tiniest aquatic landscapes.</p><p>With its slow growth rate and adaptability to various conditions, Anubias Nana ‘Petite’ is an excellent choice for both beginners and experienced aquarists seeking a low-maintenance yet visually appealing plant for their aquarium.</p><p>Plant Information:</p><p>Scientific Name: Anubias Nana ‘Petite’<br>Family: Araceae<br>Origin: West Africa<br>Difficulty Level: Easy<br>Lighting Requirements: Low to Medium<br>CO2 Requirement: Low<br>Temperature Range: 72-82°F (22-28°C)<br>pH Range: 6.0-7.5<br>Propagation: Rhizome division, cuttings</p>', NULL),
('bn_BD', 147, 'WA Bottom Dwellers Feed | 100ml – 65g', '<h4 style=\"-webkit-text-stroke-width:0px;box-sizing:border-box;color:var( --e-global-color-secondary );font-family:var( --e-global-typography-83682a1-font-family ), Sans-serif;font-size:var( --e-global-typography-83682a1-font-size );font-style:normal;font-variant-caps:normal;font-variant-ligatures:normal;font-weight:var( --e-global-typography-83682a1-font-weight );letter-spacing:normal;line-height:var( --e-global-typography-83682a1-line-height );margin-block:0.5rem 1rem;orphans:2;text-align:start;text-decoration-color:initial;text-decoration-style:initial;text-decoration-thickness:initial;text-indent:0px;text-transform:none;white-space:normal;widows:2;word-spacing:0px;\"><strong style=\"box-sizing:border-box;font-weight:bolder;\">Bottom Dwellers Food</strong></h4><ul><li>Formulated with high calcium and protein</li><li>Meets the nutritional requirement of bottom dwelling fish</li><li>Omnivore plecos, loaches, crayfish and shrimps</li><li>Sinking pellets<br>&nbsp;</li></ul><h4 style=\"box-sizing:border-box;color:var( --e-global-color-secondary );font-family:var( --e-global-typography-83682a1-font-family ), Sans-serif;font-size:var( --e-global-typography-83682a1-font-size );font-style:var( --e-global-typography-83682a1-font-style );font-weight:var( --e-global-typography-83682a1-font-weight );letter-spacing:var( --e-global-typography-83682a1-letter-spacing );line-height:var( --e-global-typography-83682a1-line-height );margin-block:0.5rem 1rem;text-transform:var( --e-global-typography-83682a1-text-transform );word-spacing:var( --e-global-typography-83682a1-word-spacing );\"><strong style=\"box-sizing:border-box;font-weight:bolder;\">WA Bottom Dwellers Feed</strong></h4><p style=\"box-sizing:border-box;margin-block:0px 0.9rem;\">WA Bottom dwellers feed is formulated with high calcium and protein to meet the nutritional requirement of bottom dwelling fish such as omnivore plecos, loaches, crayfish and shrimps.</p><h4 style=\"box-sizing:border-box;color:var( --e-global-color-secondary );font-family:var( --e-global-typography-83682a1-font-family ), Sans-serif;font-size:var( --e-global-typography-83682a1-font-size );font-style:var( --e-global-typography-83682a1-font-style );font-weight:var( --e-global-typography-83682a1-font-weight );letter-spacing:var( --e-global-typography-83682a1-letter-spacing );line-height:var( --e-global-typography-83682a1-line-height );margin-block:0.5rem 1rem;text-transform:var( --e-global-typography-83682a1-text-transform );word-spacing:var( --e-global-typography-83682a1-word-spacing );\"><strong style=\"box-sizing:border-box;font-weight:bolder;\">Ingredients</strong></h4><p style=\"box-sizing:border-box;margin-block:0px 0.9rem;\">Fish meal, Shrimp meal , Fish hydrolysate, Krill-meal, Squid meal, Soy lecithin, Fish-oil, Spirulina,<br>Beta-Carotene, Yeast powder, Vitamin A, D, E , K &amp; C, Vitamin B complex, Trace minerals (Cu, Na, Fe, I, Mn, Co, Zn &amp; Se), Amino acids and Omega-3 fatty acids</p><h4 style=\"box-sizing:border-box;color:var( --e-global-color-secondary );font-family:var( --e-global-typography-83682a1-font-family ), Sans-serif;font-size:var( --e-global-typography-83682a1-font-size );font-style:var( --e-global-typography-83682a1-font-style );font-weight:var( --e-global-typography-83682a1-font-weight );letter-spacing:var( --e-global-typography-83682a1-letter-spacing );line-height:var( --e-global-typography-83682a1-line-height );margin-block:0.5rem 1rem;text-transform:var( --e-global-typography-83682a1-text-transform );word-spacing:var( --e-global-typography-83682a1-word-spacing );\"><strong style=\"box-sizing:border-box;font-weight:bolder;\">Instruction</strong></h4><p style=\"box-sizing:border-box;margin-block:0px 0.9rem;\">Feed twice a day. Remove uneaten feed. Not for human consumption. Keep out of reach of children. Keep at room temperature</p><h4 style=\"box-sizing:border-box;color:var( --e-global-color-secondary );font-family:var( --e-global-typography-83682a1-font-family ), Sans-serif;font-size:var( --e-global-typography-83682a1-font-size );font-style:var( --e-global-typography-83682a1-font-style );font-weight:var( --e-global-typography-83682a1-font-weight );letter-spacing:var( --e-global-typography-83682a1-letter-spacing );line-height:var( --e-global-typography-83682a1-line-height );margin-block:0.5rem 1rem;text-transform:var( --e-global-typography-83682a1-text-transform );word-spacing:var( --e-global-typography-83682a1-word-spacing );\"><strong style=\"box-sizing:border-box;font-weight:bolder;\">Nutritional Fact</strong></h4><p style=\"box-sizing:border-box;margin-block:0px 0.9rem;\">Protein – 46%<br>Fat – 6%<br>Fiber – 4%<br>Moisture – 9%</p><h4 style=\"box-sizing:border-box;color:var( --e-global-color-secondary );font-family:var( --e-global-typography-83682a1-font-family ), Sans-serif;font-size:var( --e-global-typography-83682a1-font-size );font-style:var( --e-global-typography-83682a1-font-style );font-weight:var( --e-global-typography-83682a1-font-weight );letter-spacing:var( --e-global-typography-83682a1-letter-spacing );line-height:var( --e-global-typography-83682a1-line-height );margin-block:0.5rem 1rem;text-transform:var( --e-global-typography-83682a1-text-transform );word-spacing:var( --e-global-typography-83682a1-word-spacing );\"><strong style=\"box-sizing:border-box;font-weight:bolder;\">Bottom Dwellers Food</strong></h4><ul><li>Formulated with high calcium and protein</li><li>Meets the nutritional requirement of bottom dwelling fish</li><li>Omnivore plecos, loaches, crayfish and shrimps</li><li>Sinking pellets</li></ul>', NULL),
