('bn_BD', 149, 'WA Eterno Goldfish Sinking Pellets 220G', '<p style=\"-webkit-text-stroke-width:0px;box-sizing:border-box;color:rgb(105, 105, 105);font-family:Poppins, sans-serif;font-size:16px;font-style:normal;font-variant-caps:normal;font-variant-ligatures:normal;font-weight:400;letter-spacing:normal;margin-block:0px 0.9rem;orphans:2;text-align:start;text-decoration-color:initial;text-decoration-style:initial;text-decoration-thickness:initial;text-indent:0px;text-transform:none;white-space:normal;widows:2;word-spacing:0px;\"><strong style=\"box-sizing:border-box;font-weight:bolder;\">WA Eterno Gold fish Sinking Pellets 220gm :</strong></p><p style=\"-webkit-text-stroke-width:0px;box-sizing:border-box;color:rgb(105, 105, 105);font-family:Poppins, sans-serif;font-size:16px;font-style:normal;font-variant-caps:normal;font-variant-ligatures:normal;font-weight:400;letter-spacing:normal;margin-block:0px 0.9rem;orphans:2;text-align:start;text-decoration-color:initial;text-decoration-style:initial;text-decoration-thickness:initial;text-indent:0px;text-transform:none;white-space:normal;widows:2;word-spacing:0px;\">Eterno goldfish feed specifically made for premium goldfish with high protein sinking pellets. It contains specialty vitamins, amino acids, minerals for the gold fish to look vibrant&nbsp; and colourful naturally.</p><p style=\"-webkit-text-stroke-width:0px;box-sizing:border-box;color:rgb(105, 105, 105);font-family:Poppins, sans-serif;font-size:16px;font-style:normal;font-variant-caps:normal;font-variant-ligatures:normal;font-weight:400;letter-spacing:normal;margin-block:0px 0.9rem;orphans:2;text-align:start;text-decoration-color:initial;text-decoration-style:initial;text-decoration-thickness:initial;text-indent:0px;text-transform:none;white-space:normal;widows:2;word-spacing:0px;\">This Goldfish Sinking Pellets made with marine fish &amp; shrimp meal, krill-meal, Soy lecithin, Fish Oil, Lutein, Astaxanthine, Spirulina, Beta-Carotene, Yeast extract, Vitamin A D E K &amp; C, Vitamin B Complex, Inositol, Trace minerals ( Cu, Na, Fe, I, Mn, Co, Zn, Se ) Amino acids ( Including DL – methionine, L- lysine, L- threonine,&nbsp; arginine, alanine ) &amp; natural plant fiber ingredients.</p><p style=\"-webkit-text-stroke-width:0px;box-sizing:border-box;color:rgb(105, 105, 105);font-family:Poppins, sans-serif;font-size:16px;font-style:normal;font-variant-caps:normal;font-variant-ligatures:normal;font-weight:400;letter-spacing:normal;margin-block:0px 0.9rem;orphans:2;text-align:start;text-decoration-color:initial;text-decoration-style:initial;text-decoration-thickness:initial;text-indent:0px;text-transform:none;white-space:normal;widows:2;word-spacing:0px;\">Feed twice a day. Remove uneaten feed. Not for human consumption. Keep out of reach of children. Keep at room temperature.</p>', NULL),
('bn_BD', 150, 'WA Goldfish Grandeur Pellets 200G', '<p style=\"-webkit-text-stroke-width:0px;box-sizing:border-box;color:rgb(105, 105, 105);font-family:Poppins, sans-serif;font-size:16px;font-style:normal;font-variant-caps:normal;font-variant-ligatures:normal;font-weight:400;letter-spacing:normal;margin-block:0px 0.9rem;orphans:2;text-align:start;text-decoration-color:initial;text-decoration-style:initial;text-decoration-thickness:initial;text-indent:0px;text-transform:none;white-space:normal;widows:2;word-spacing:0px;\"><strong style=\"box-sizing:border-box;font-weight:bolder;\">WA Goldfish Grandeur Pellets 200g</strong></p><p style=\"-webkit-text-stroke-width:0px;box-sizing:border-box;color:rgb(105, 105, 105);font-family:Poppins, sans-serif;font-size:16px;font-style:normal;font-variant-caps:normal;font-variant-ligatures:normal;font-weight:400;letter-spacing:normal;margin-block:0px 0.9rem;orphans:2;text-align:start;text-decoration-color:initial;text-decoration-style:initial;text-decoration-thickness:initial;text-indent:0px;text-transform:none;white-space:normal;widows:2;word-spacing:0px;\">Goldfish is a voracious eater, it keeps on eating until you stop feeding. Do not feed too much volume of feed, as it may cause water pollution and also digestion problem.</p><h4 style=\"-webkit-text-stroke-width:0px;box-sizing:border-box;color:var( --e-global-color-secondary );font-family:var( --e-global-typography-83682a1-font-family ), Sans-serif;font-size:var( --e-global-typography-83682a1-font-size );font-style:normal;font-variant-caps:normal;font-variant-ligatures:normal;font-weight:var( --e-global-typography-83682a1-font-weight );letter-spacing:normal;line-height:var( --e-global-typography-83682a1-line-height );margin-block:0.5rem 1rem;orphans:2;text-align:start;text-decoration-color:initial;text-decoration-style:initial;text-decoration-thickness:initial;text-indent:0px;text-transform:none;white-space:normal;widows:2;word-spacing:0px;\"><strong style=\"box-sizing:border-bo