('bn_BD', 216, 'FIREGLOW PLUS ONELY WRGB 25W', '<p style=\"-webkit-text-stroke-width:0px;box-sizing:border-box;color:rgb(105, 105, 105);font-family:Poppins, sans-serif;font-size:16px;font-style:normal;font-variant-caps:normal;font-variant-ligatures:normal;font-weight:400;letter-spacing:normal;margin-block:0px 0.9rem;orphans:2;text-align:start;text-decoration-color:initial;text-decoration-style:initial;text-decoration-thickness:initial;text-indent:0px;text-transform:none;white-space:normal;widows:2;word-spacing:0px;\">FIREGLOW PLUS ONELY WRGB 25W</p><p style=\"-webkit-text-stroke-width:0px;box-sizing:border-box;color:rgb(105, 105, 105);font-family:Poppins, sans-serif;font-size:16px;font-style:normal;font-variant-caps:normal;font-variant-ligatures:normal;font-weight:400;letter-spacing:normal;margin-block:0px 0.9rem;orphans:2;text-align:start;text-decoration-color:initial;text-decoration-style:initial;text-decoration-thickness:initial;text-indent:0px;text-transform:none;white-space:normal;widows:2;word-spacing:0px;\">●Super Flexible Stand<br>●Dual Round Panel LED with WRGB LED<br>●ABS&nbsp; Body.<br>●Polycarbonate based Transparent Splash Guard.<br>●Support upto 12mm glass thickness</p><p style=\"-webkit-text-stroke-width:0px;box-sizing:border-box;color:rgb(105, 105, 105);font-family:Poppins, sans-serif;font-size:16px;font-style:normal;font-variant-caps:normal;font-variant-ligatures:normal;font-weight:400;letter-spacing:normal;margin-block:0px 0.9rem;orphans:2;text-align:start;text-decoration-color:initial;text-decoration-style:initial;text-decoration-thickness:initial;text-indent:0px;text-transform:none;white-space:normal;widows:2;word-spacing:0px;\">Specifications</p><p style=\"-webkit-text-stroke-width:0px;box-sizing:border-box;color:rgb(105, 105, 105);font-family:Poppins, sans-serif;font-size:16px;font-style:normal;font-variant-caps:normal;font-variant-ligatures:normal;font-weight:400;letter-spacing:normal;margin-block:0px 0.9rem;orphans:2;text-align:start;text-dec